<</Type/Annot/Subtype/FreeText/P 9 0 R/F 4/M(D:20260623092638+04'00')/NM(15e532e3-0482-4da9-a0ca-77ceebe8bddd)/Contents(The member enters his name, the system gives him a memberId automatically, the librarian checks if the member isActive. After that the member enters his details and enters the book title, the system checks if the book is available if it is available the member takes a Loan and the system records the borrow date, calculates the due date automatically and decreases one copy from the stock. When the member returns the book, the librarian checks if he returned it on time if on time the system closes the Loan and adds the copy back to the stock, if late the system calculates a fine automatically based on the number of overdue days.)/CA 1/CreationDate(D:20260623092053+04'00')/IT/FreeTextTypewriter/BS<</Type/Border/W 0/S/S>>/Rotate 0/DA(11.760000 TL /Helv 10.500000 Tf 0 0 0 rg 0 0 0 RG )/AP<</N 1931 0 R>>/Rect[ 59.099984 707.249099 539.099984 789.749099]/C[ 0 0 0]>>
